        "requiredEvidence": "Integrate the accepted AC5 Faction Champion (Humanoid) crossing a Gate fixed to Elemental alongside retained matching allied/enemy Elemental admissions. Bind acquisition/preparation, full actor state, faction identifier, alliedStatus=true, standing >0, invocation permission, no aid prohibition, Action/V/S/F/10 RP/60-ft placement/original 60-second concentration. Record lawful command and movement through 10x15-ft aperture. Humanoid crossing: no exile/save/hard denial. Keep unknown-type behavior as a separate nondiagnostic control."
