        ],
        "requiredEvidence": "Legally create and admit an accepted finite summon with separately sourced genuine cargo. At original source deadline end body/intrinsic gear without corpse, preserve genuine objects and execute Gate’s selected terminal settlement including occupied/blocked placement. No duplicate item, recreated body, second ending, refill or refund."
      }
